@username = massielcr

### HttpMethod.Head

GET {{HostAddress}}/sendasync/users/{{username}}/avatar HTTP/2
Accept: application/json

### HttpMethod.Options

GET {{HostAddress}}/sendasync/users/{{username}}/options  HTTP/2
Accept: application/json






